# AI assistant — FREE by default, no key needed.
# The app uses Pollinations.ai, a free keyless OpenAI-compatible provider.
# Rate-limited to ~1 request / 5s on the free tier.
#
# Optional upgrades (only if you want to):
#   - Set AI_API_KEY to use any OpenAI-compatible provider (OpenAI, Groq,
#     OpenRouter, etc.) instead of the free one.
#   - Set AI_MODEL to pick a different model.
#     Free default: "openai" · With key default: "gpt-4o-mini"
